abstract: >-
  Conceptual and applied scientific essay protocol examining the tactical athlete
  construct as a starting point for a broader, multidimensional model of operational
  readiness in Brazilian public safety. The project is informed by structured and
  reproducible evidence identification, critical synthesis, Brazilian contextual
  analysis, transferability assessment, and implementation-science concepts.
